Description: Ronmi's Twice Flavored Shell, a QuickShell desktop shell for niri
 rtfs (Ronmi's Twice Flavored Shell) is a personal desktop shell built
 with QuickShell: bar, notifications, launcher, OSD, wallpaper, lock
 screen, polkit agent and a generic dialog toolkit (rtfs-ui, with
 zenity and pinentry adapters), styled with the
 TWICE color scheme.
 .
 The shell is installed as QuickShell's system-wide default config
 (/etc/xdg/quickshell), so a plain "qs" runs it unless
 ~/.config/quickshell overrides it. Setup outside the package (niri
 config, gpg-agent) is described in /usr/share/doc/rtfs/README.Debian.
